<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;{!Credit_Request__c.OwnerFirstName},&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The credit request you submitted for&nbsp;</span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!Credit_Request__c.Company_Name__c} (uLab Acct #&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!Credit_Request__c.uLab_Acct_Number__c}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">)&nbsp;</span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">has been <b>rejected</b>.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">A&nbsp; l</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">ink to the Credit Request can be found here:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!Credit_Request__c.Link}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">You can resubmit this request if necessary or can you open a new Credit Request when/if the time comes.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks</div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
